/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed588156842/2/prompt.md:272:- For each lattice row, find the cell whose inner pattern appears exactly once (the "odd one out").
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed588156842/2/prompt.md:273:- Construct a single-column lattice preserving the original row heights, containing only the unique cells.
