/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed588156842/2/prompt.md:299:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed588156842/2/prompt.md:300:Slide yellow pixels inside walled regions in the direction dictated by border-legend arrows.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed588156842/2/prompt.md:301:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed588156842/2/prompt.md:302:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed588156842/2/prompt.md:303:- bg = most common color; yellow pixels sit inside enclosed regions bounded by colored walls.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed588156842/2/prompt.md:304:- Border legends: small rectangles on the grid edge whose fill color C matches a region's border color. Each legend contains a center dot and an indicator dot encoding a direction.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed588156842/2/prompt.md:305:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed588156842/2/prompt.md:306:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed588156842/2/prompt.md:307:- For each enclosed region, identify its border color C and look up the legend with fill color C.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed588156842/2/prompt.md:308:- The direction from the legend's center dot to its indicator dot gives the slide direction.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed588156842/2/prompt.md:309:- All yellow pixels in that region slide in that direction, stacking against the far wall.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed588156842/2/prompt.md:310:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed588156842/2/prompt.md:311:Key insight: Legend fill color links to region border color; the center→indicator offset encodes the movement vector.
