/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed588156842/2/prompt.md:316:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed588156842/2/prompt.md:317:Transfer center colors between bordered sprites matched by color, keeping only path-connected ones.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed588156842/2/prompt.md:318:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed588156842/2/prompt.md:319:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed588156842/2/prompt.md:320:- bg, grey (5) path network, and several small "bordered sprites" each having a border color and a single center pixel of a different color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed588156842/2/prompt.md:321:- Grey path forms a one-stroke trail under 8-connectivity; its start/end cells touch exactly two destination sprites via ports.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed588156842/2/prompt.md:322:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed588156842/2/prompt.md:323:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed588156842/2/prompt.md:324:- Destination sprites are determined by the grey trail's two endpoints.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed588156842/2/prompt.md:325:- For each destination, find the source sprite whose border color equals the destination's center color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed588156842/2/prompt.md:326:- Replace the destination's center pixel with the source's center color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed588156842/2/prompt.md:327:- Delete all non-destination sprites; grey paths and destinations remain.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed588156842/2/prompt.md:328:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed588156842/2/prompt.md:329:Key insight: Center color of each destination acts as a lookup key into the border colors of other sprites, enabling indirect color transfer.
