/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed588156842/2/prompt.md:334:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed588156842/2/prompt.md:335:Dock movable tools into border-anchored frames by filling cavities.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed588156842/2/prompt.md:336:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed588156842/2/prompt.md:337:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed588156842/2/prompt.md:338:- bg = most common color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed588156842/2/prompt.md:339:- Border-touching components cluster into anchor frames with interior bg cavities.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed588156842/2/prompt.md:340:- Non-border 2-color components are movable tools.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed588156842/2/prompt.md:341:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed588156842/2/prompt.md:342:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed588156842/2/prompt.md:343:- Match each tool to a frame whose cavity size equals one of its color-region counts.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed588156842/2/prompt.md:344:- Rotate/flip the tool so one color fills the cavity exactly; the other stays outside.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed588156842/2/prompt.md:345:- If the docking orientation uses a reflection, swap the tool's two colors.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed588156842/2/prompt.md:346:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed588156842/2/prompt.md:347:Key insight: Cavity size determines tool–frame pairing; reflection triggers color swap.
